      "note": "N884FD (777F) left side, side-on, landing at Beijing 2026-10-30: fitted to shapes/B77L.json with tools/photo_trace.py (nose, tail, fin tip, forward door; within 8 px). The purple, the stripe, the fin and the titles are measured off it."
